<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>Commercial property claims usually involve several coverages at once: building, business personal property (BPP), business income, and extra expense, each with its own limits and conditions.</li>
<li>A coinsurance clause can reduce payment on a partial loss if the property was underinsured. Agreed value options may suspend it.</li>
